        "type": "panorama",
        "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/Panorama_Half_Dome.jpg",
        "degrees": 270
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "half-dome",
      "title": "Half Dome",
      "description": "A view of Half Dome's distinctive granite profile.",
