        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/Half_dome_in_national_park_great_mountain.jpg"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "historic-firefall",
      "title": "The Historic Yosemite Firefall",
      "description": "A historical photograph of the former man-made Glacier Point Firefall, not the present-day Horsetail Fall sunlight phenomenon.",
